   "body": "/claim cloud/i1397-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- Smiley/GIF cells (finding 1): one shared image fetcher (the one `AppEnvironment` already builds) injected into `SmileyImageLoader`, with an in-flight map per URL and a bounded memory cache; counting loopback transport test (N cells, same URL → 1 request; distinct cells share one transport).\n- Picker (finding 2): the picker's form/own-smileys lists live as long as the composer, second open → 0 request.\n- Avatars (findings 3, 5): avoid the double download where the engine allows it; negative cache for MP-row avatars (finding 4), 24 h.\n- Each finding as a test seen red first; the cookie-less image client and image policy (LOT-083) are kept. App code reviewed with compiler rigour (no Linux build); engine tests via `swift test`.\n- One PR, draft first, Opus review, no merge.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
